<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>중독뉴스 | Addiction News</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

  <!-- 외부 CSS -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="./assets/css/style.css" />
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <header>
    <div class="header-inner">
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="brand-logo">
          <span class="logo-a">A</span><span class="logo-n">N</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="brand-text-title">중독뉴스</div>
          <div class="brand-text-sub">Addiction News</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav class="nav-menu">
        <div class="nav-item" onclick="alert('중독사회 메인으로 연결 예정입니다.')">
          중독사회
        </div>
        <div class="nav-item active">중독뉴스</div>
        <div class="nav-item">소개</div>
        <div class="nav-item">문의</div>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="main-wrap">
    <section class="top-panel">
      <div class="search-box">
        <span class="search-icon">🔍</span>
        <input
          id="searchInput"
          type="text"
          class="search-input"
          placeholder="키워드로 기사 검색 (제목, 태그, 요약)"
        />
      </div>

      <!-- 검색 자동완성 리스트 -->
      <div id="searchSuggest" class="autocomplete-wrap"></div>

      <div class="category-tabs" id="categoryTabs"></div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="top-highlights" id="topHighlights"></div>

      <div class="articles-header">
        <div class="articles-title" id="articlesTitle"></div>
        <div class="articles-meta" id="articlesMeta"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="articles-wrap" id="articlesWrap"></div>
      <div class="load-more-wrap" id="loadMoreWrap"></div>
    </section>

    <aside class="hot-sidebar">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-title">오늘의 주요 이슈 뉴스</div>
        <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--color-text-muted);margin-bottom:6px;">
          각 카테고리에서 자동 선정된 상위 이슈입니다 (최신 기사 기준).
        </div>
        <div class="hot-list" id="hotList"></div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </main>

  <footer>
    ⓒ 중독사회 · 중독뉴스 Addiction Society Hub · 문의: contact@example.org
  </footer>
</div>

<!-- 외부 JS -->
<script src="./assets/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
